  <item>
    <title>vol.08 神奇萌物在哪里，宝藏博主告诉你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6403237186730b8173743995</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6403237186730b8173743995</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Mar 2023 10:54:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvRtBJFVFlFJnd-UNpq6XDWQHK1e.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>vol.08 节目简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在短视频的世界里，有这样一群主角他们始终不说“人话”甚至有时拒绝沟通，但是露个脸却能轻轻松松收获百万流量，比人类KOL更能吸粉，他们就是既能暖你心头又能把你气哭的小宠物。随着城市空巢青年、晚婚晚育人群的逐年增多，养一只宠物似乎已经成了现代年轻人的精神寄托。那么这一期我们就把目光聚焦在网络上的宠物账号，破解流量密码的同时也带你一起云吸宠！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要谈及的账号：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>纪实类宠物日常：ipanda熊猫频道、和猫住、香香软软的小泡芙、猫不理猫咖、一木一叶造景老李、熊乐乐大魔王、悠然是比熊yoyo、闪电姐姐的龙猫阿呆</span></p><span></span><p><span>娱乐类：在下铁头阿彪、料理猫王、小帅家的大狼狗们</span></p><span></span><p><span>科普测评类：爱宝家、知了解压萌物、喵懂百科</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在这里，您将听到以下内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 为什么追看小动物视频？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 喜欢看哪类动物视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 纪实动物类博主推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 和猫住这类公益账号存在的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 娱乐类宠物博主的创作特色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 在下铁头阿彪等娱乐类宠物博主精彩的评论区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 科普测评类视频如何实现知识的软着陆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 爱宝家和喵懂百科以名字吸引流量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 不以猫狗为主角的账号有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2146">35:46</a> 流量密码VS亲密的伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目中观点仅代表主播个人，理性讨论Peace&amp;Love】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPm0unVz5sK3XcVX9FnI2XPup6C.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEC778DXSW8a_mOJr-F75OzaoJv.png"></figure>]]></description>
